# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Back to the road and follow it south all the way to Booty Bay at the southern tip of the vale, and enter through the tunnel in the cliffs. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is well above your level. Gringer, the Horde flight master, waits on the inn's upper deck.
  accept 575 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Drizzlik, inside
  vendor nearest
  accept 605 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Crank Fizzlebub, inside, on the bottom floor
  accept 213 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Kebok, upstairs
  accept 189 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Kebok
  accept 201 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Krazek, upstairs
  getfp "Booty Bay" npc 2858 -- Gringer

