# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Vile Reef and the Bloodscalp ruins

step The Vile Reef
  tip North-west of Grom'gol the Vile Reef lies under the water off the coast. The Tablet Shard rests on the sea floor by the sunken ruins; watch your breath and the murlocs.
  level 35
  collect 4094 quest 629 @24.8,22.9 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Underwater

step Bal'lal Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Bloodscalp Headhunters (36-37) in the village on the coast carry the shrunken heads. Careful: the 37s can be two over you: pull them one at a time from the village's edge, never into the middle with the Witch Doctors.
  tip The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins up the coast north of the reef and the village beyond; every one can drop a Bloody Bone Necklace. Keep looting pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn.
  collect 3915 quest 596 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 1532 quest 582 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  turnin 582 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Nimboya

