step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Still below 36 after Grom'gol's hand-ins? The Snapjaw Crocolisks (35-36) line the river just east of the camp, below the Mosh'Ogg hills: kill them until level 36, then walk back to the zeppelin tower. Leave the Mosh'Ogg ogres (36-37) above them alone.
  goto 38.4,31.0 map 1434 "Snapjaw Crocolisks"
